1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Paralysed and unable to speak. Their avatar talks and waves.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
An ECoG implant records signals from the brain

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Machine learning turns those signals into words and gestures

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Speech and gestures like nodding and waving, at once

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,500
UCSF, the Chang lab, a neuroprosthesis for paralysis

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Three participants. Two drove the avatar in real time.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Wired, in a lab. A demonstration, not a treatment.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Talking and gesturing together, the way people communicate
